hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"264","On the authority of Ishaq bin Ibrahim bin Habib bin Al-Shahid, on the authority of Ibn Fudayl, on the authority of Abu Malik Al-Ashja’i, on the authority of Rabi’i bin Harash, on the authority of Hudhayfah Ibn Al-Yaman said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “We were preferred over the people by three things: the entire earth was made for us a place of mosque, and its soil was made We will be purified when we do not find water, and our rows will be made like the rows of angels, and these verses will be given to us from the end of Surat Al-Baqarah, from the House of Treasure. Under the Throne, no one before me, nor anyone after me, was given anything of it.”"
